<title>USA: Tel-Save says Q1 EPS to be $0.12-$0.13.</title>
<headline>Tel-Save says Q1 EPS to be $0.12-$0.13.</headline>
<dateline>NEW HOPE, Pa 1997-03-13</dateline>
<text>
<p>Tel-Save Holdings Inc said Thursday its first-quarter earnings per share will be about $0.12 to $0.13 -- higher than Wall Street estimates.</p>
<p>The telecommunications company said its earnings would be at least 20 percent higher than the $0.10 expected by analysts.</p>
<p>In the same quarter a year ago, Tel-Save had earnings of $0.07 a share.</p>
</text>
